      'Test loader bounds262144 and hashes exact current010 bytes before future isolated004 module compile/exec; no selected source compiler/import/definitions/tests called here.',
      'Closed schema Source literals checked against contract; config18/Core12/trace13/trust8/init8/phase10/ticket22/phasepeer20/driver26/projection13 remain exact within their branches.',
